<title>QATAR: TENNIS-QATAR OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-QATAR OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the $635,000 Qatar Open on Saturday:</p>
<p> Tim Henman (Britain) beat Hicham Arazi (Morocco) 6-3     2-6</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>8-Jim Courier (U.S.) beat Sergi Bruguera (Spain) 6-4 6-2</p>
</text>
